# 301 redirects: force the .html variants to their clean/extensionless URLs.
# Cloudflare static-assets serves clean URLs automatically; these make the
# .html form a permanent 301 instead of the platform default, and consolidate
# link equity on the canonical URL.
#
# HTTPS redirect: handled by Cloudflare dashboard (SSL/TLS > Edge Certificates >
# "Always Use HTTPS" toggle). The _redirects file cannot intercept http:// requests
# because Cloudflare terminates TLS at the edge before the worker sees the request.

